1
00:00:09,230 --> 00:00:10,350
(Tram drop-off)

2
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:39,360
=Vow of Autumn=
=Episode 1=

3
00:00:39,899 --> 00:00:40,500
Ms. Wen.

4
00:00:41,159 --> 00:00:42,159
I want a divorce.

5
00:00:43,060 --> 00:00:44,219
(Wen Wanqing, lawyer)
He cheated.

6
00:00:45,899 --> 00:00:47,179
I took these photos

7
00:00:47,460 --> 00:00:49,020
outside a hotel.

8
00:00:49,899 --> 00:00:50,939
For the past six months,

9
00:00:51,060 --> 00:00:52,899
I've been smelling

10
00:00:52,899 --> 00:00:54,899
other women's perfume on him.

11
00:00:55,280 --> 00:00:57,600
Your perfume smells lovely, Ms. Wen.

12
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:00,500
Just like

13
00:01:01,179 --> 00:01:02,320
that woman's perfume, right?

14
00:01:04,620 --> 00:01:05,799
I'm sorry, Ms. Li.

15
00:01:06,420 --> 00:01:08,219
I have a conflict of interest,

16
00:01:08,439 --> 00:01:09,180
so I can't take it.

17
00:01:09,640 --> 00:01:11,659
I'll refer you to a suitable colleague.

18
00:01:12,939 --> 00:01:14,439
You're remarkably calm.

19
00:01:15,400 --> 00:01:16,620
I just don't get it.

20
00:01:17,060 --> 00:01:19,540
You're pretty and have good presence,

21
00:01:19,719 --> 00:01:21,719
why be so eager to be a mistress?

22
00:01:24,099 --> 00:01:24,939
One moment, please.

23
00:01:25,159 --> 00:01:26,719
I'll have a colleague take over.

24
00:01:32,920 --> 00:01:33,719
Wanqing.

25
00:02:03,280 --> 00:02:03,819
Girl!

26
00:02:04,159 --> 00:02:05,700
(Su Mu, independent curator, her BFF)
How much have you had?

27
00:02:07,780 --> 00:02:09,120
You're finally here.

28
00:02:11,020 --> 00:02:11,659
Tell me.

29
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:12,759
What happened?

30
00:02:13,360 --> 00:02:14,979
That jerk Zhou Ze.

31
00:02:15,400 --> 00:02:17,860
His wife came to my office today

32
00:02:18,360 --> 00:02:20,680
and asked me to handle their divorce.

33
00:02:22,560 --> 00:02:24,099
Everyone knew

34
00:02:24,099 --> 00:02:25,159
except me!

35
00:02:25,319 --> 00:02:25,719
I...

36
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:27,599
But...

37
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:30,259
when Zhou Ze showed up,

38
00:02:30,800 --> 00:02:32,099
I slapped him.

39
00:02:34,020 --> 00:02:34,599
Nice!

40
00:02:34,780 --> 00:02:36,020
What's good about it?

41
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:38,139
I'm still not over it.

42
00:02:38,319 --> 00:02:39,919
I'm not satisfied, you know?

43
00:02:39,919 --> 00:02:41,039
I know. I get it.

44
00:02:41,039 --> 00:02:41,560
Come on.

45
00:02:42,180 --> 00:02:43,319
Let's go up there and dance.

46
00:02:43,319 --> 00:02:44,360
Dance the bad luck away.

47
00:02:44,360 --> 00:02:44,840
Come on.

48
00:02:44,840 --> 00:02:46,520
Slow down. Easy!

49
00:03:04,240 --> 00:03:06,480
(Gu Yuan, attorney at Hengyuan Law Firm)

50
00:03:23,680 --> 00:03:26,100
(In Operation)

51
00:03:32,380 --> 00:03:35,460
(Sis)

52
00:03:35,460 --> 00:03:38,300
(Authorized personnel only)

53
00:03:39,180 --> 00:03:40,819
Okay, got it.

54
00:03:40,979 --> 00:03:42,659
Send me the location. I'll be there.

55
00:03:49,260 --> 00:03:51,720
(Pei Yiqiu, attending neurosurgeon,
Su Mu's younger brother)

56
00:03:56,419 --> 00:03:57,039
Sis.

57
00:04:01,379 --> 00:04:02,000
You're here.

58
00:04:02,860 --> 00:04:04,020
She's all yours. Gotta go.

59
00:04:22,300 --> 00:04:24,800
(DPX)

60
00:04:25,160 --> 00:04:25,939
Sis.

61
00:04:29,720 --> 00:04:31,800
Hey, handsome.

62
00:04:33,660 --> 00:04:34,759
Did you come alone?

63
00:04:35,459 --> 00:04:37,079
You're just my type.

64
00:04:37,379 --> 00:04:38,079
Sis.

65
00:04:38,300 --> 00:04:39,100
You're drunk.

66
00:04:39,660 --> 00:04:40,720
I'm Pei Yiqiu.

67
00:04:40,879 --> 00:04:41,439
My sister...

68
00:04:50,180 --> 00:04:53,620
(DPX)

69
00:05:01,819 --> 00:05:02,540
Careful.

70
00:05:08,740 --> 00:05:09,699
I'll get you water.

71
00:05:19,079 --> 00:05:20,120
Don't go.

72
00:05:20,660 --> 00:05:21,579
Stay with me.

73
00:05:24,959 --> 00:05:25,759
Wen Wanqing.

74
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:28,779
Look closely. Who am I?

75
00:06:20,639 --> 00:06:21,480
Oh, gosh.

76
00:06:22,439 --> 00:06:24,060
I'm in my 30s now.

77
00:06:24,620 --> 00:06:25,800
My poor old bones.

78
00:06:40,300 --> 00:06:41,120
What happened?

79
00:06:45,279 --> 00:06:47,639
Come on, my brain. Think!

80
00:06:55,339 --> 00:06:57,779
My brain can't remember!

81
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:34,720
Morning.

82
00:07:42,639 --> 00:07:43,279
Well...

83
00:07:43,540 --> 00:07:44,720
Listen.

84
00:07:45,399 --> 00:07:47,300
I've thought long and hard

85
00:07:47,300 --> 00:07:48,680
about what happened last night,

86
00:07:49,160 --> 00:07:50,420
but I can't remember...

87
00:07:53,220 --> 00:07:54,420
Qiu?

88
00:07:56,959 --> 00:07:59,759
You're Qiu, right?

89
00:08:14,120 --> 00:08:15,379
Su Mu's younger brother,

90
00:08:15,800 --> 00:08:16,519
Pei Yiqiu?

91
00:08:41,200 --> 00:08:43,100
(Tram drop-off)
